# Licensed brand fonts (Gilroy, Proxima Nova) — see public/fonts/README.md.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Committing a commercial webfont to it would be
# redistribution, which no standard webfont licence covers, so the files stay
# local: drop them in, they work on this machine, git never sees them.
#
# The cost is that they do not survive a fresh clone or a new Claude session.
# If the repository is made private, delete these two lines and commit the
# fonts — then the prototype renders in the real brand faces everywhere,
# permanently, and the OFL stand-ins can go.
public/fonts/*.woff2
public/fonts/*.woff
